  "the eldest son: \"Well, and what is it you are about, then?\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung turns and goes back to the fields.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son speaks to his father about his son's wedding.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son speaks about his son's wedding and his father's fields.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son follows his father into the fields.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and when is it you would like your son to be married to?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and what is it to you, I wonder?\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung asks his son about the wedding plans.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what is it all about, my son?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Tell me your own mind, my son, and if it be what you will, and if you have chosen the lad, I will have the marriage.\"",
  "the second son: \"No!\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and you have no choice in the matter, my father. But you are not to be so proud and haughty and so full of your own will.\"",
